/v1/","context":{"app_id":4419320,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-4419320","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:13Z","value":0,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=5250900","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4419320-1844115010497027","game_id":"steam-4419320","kind":"announcement","title":"The \"Scourge Realms\" Demo is Live!","summary":"The time has come! The demo for Scourge Realms is now live.13 unique skills present in demo (you can re-spec anytime).Various enchantments to augment and empower your build with.2 difficulty tiers to complete.3 realms to traverse and slay scourge in.Plenty of treasures to be found!An In game guide menu to help you get started.Gameplay/quality of life improvements (improved from playtest build).I hope the demo experience is enjoyable, and thanks to all who gives this project a chance.Game balance","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-19T11:44:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010497027","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4419320-1836506165578084","game_id":"steam-4419320","kind":"update","title":"Skills | Development Update #2","summary":"Hello all, I wanted to share a quick development update and discuss what I have been working.Skills I recently finished all skills planned for the 1.0 Build of the game and I also did a redesign of theskills menu. (it was kind of chaotic in the playtest build.)As shown in the image above, there will be 4 base categories for skill types:MeleeBowSpellSpecial The design philosophy behind skills in Scourge Realms is that the perk nodes related to each skill will reward players for optimal itemizatio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-07T13:48:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165578084","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4419320-1833334318579215","game_id":"steam-4419320","kind":"announcement","title":"Scourge Realms Open Playtest is Live!","summary":"The open playtest for Scourge Realms is now live!In this playtest build you can:Slay monsters.Find loot.Buy/sell gear via the merchant.Enchant items.Attempt to complete a full \"Scourge Tier: I\" playthrough. (Successfully clear 10/10 waves).Please be aware of the following:This is a Playtest. Not a demo build.There will be bugs/glitches.The game may crash.Performance issues may occur.Only small fraction of the full games content is present in this build.The game is in daily active development and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-26T12:21:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318579215","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4419320-1832700592786601","game_id":"steam-4419320","kind":"update","title":"Progression Overview & Upcoming Playtest | Development Update #1","summary":"Hello all, This is the first development update for \"Scourge Realms\", and I have quite a bit to share.PROGRESSION \"Scourge Realms\" is an Action RPG at its core that borrows some gameplay features of roguelikes. Each run will start fresh and challenges will vary with each run. What will not vary is your progression. All of your xp, loot, crafting materials will be persistent in-between runs, allowing you to build up a strong character capable of clearing harder but more rewarding content.THE HOME","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-13T14:50:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592786601","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:06:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4419320":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:04Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:04Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4419320":"2026-10-26T02:30:04Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4419320":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:04Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:04Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5250900":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:04Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:30:04Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4419320","app_id":4419320,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:35Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"a935fc61313a0a794aae7b66c26d9ce418821bd7cb1e9d601709f024df6df29d","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Slay monsters in evil realms inflicted with scourge. Find Majestic Loot, Collect powerful enchanting materials and xp to survive the scourge and obtain god-like power.","publishers":[{"name":"Etheric Origin","creator_clan_account_id":45996632}],"developers":[{"name":"Etheric Origin","creator_clan_account_id":45996632}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1796396400,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_full"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Scourge Realms - Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1787628116","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"4419320/415347090/b7eb60f0770d5605b1